  "keyFeatures": [
    "Natural-language capture of plans, trips, expenses, bills, and contacts in English, Hinglish, and Hindi",
    "Escalating reminder engine with per-user notification chains via Web Push",
    "Deterministic date/recurrence parsers — no LLM required for most inputs",
    "Conflict detection: time-slot clashes and travel-distance warnings between plans",
    "Google and Microsoft calendar/mail OAuth integration (read-only mirroring)",
    "AI-assisted capture (Anthropic/Ollama, bring-your-own-key, opt-in only)",
    "Offline-capable PWA with IndexedDB outbox and idempotent sync",
    "Android TWA (Trusted Web Activity) via Bubblewrap",
    "Multi-tenant with org-scoped data and role-based access (owner / member)",
    "Morning brief, daily nudge, meeting prep, weekly review, and focus-block workers"
  ],
